I’m going to retrieve all your API tokens for you.  
First, I’ll fetch the standard API tokens:

```json
{
  "name": "api_token_api_APITokenApi_get_api_tokens",
  "arguments": {
    "user_id": "12345",
    "include_expired": true
  }
}
```

Once I have that response, I’ll call the second function to get the shareable dashboard tokens.
